en:
{0E}"You came back!?
Just what's a bunch of two-bit adventurers findin' so amusin'...{0F}
Hmm..."{w}{p}"Say, you folks, lemme ask you somethin'...{w}You got any business over at the Rinos Sea Volcano?"{w}{p}"Thing is, the rookie went and cracked my whetstones...{w}The rookie? Oh, I gave the kid a good earful, naturally."{w}{p}"So here's the deal. Could you nip over to the Rinos Sea Volcano and dig me up some whetstones?{w}Maintenance tools are the most important thing after carpentry tools."{w}

{0E}"Good with a sword? More skilled than anyone?
Compared to who, exactly?{0F}
What a load of nonsense... Ukiki!"{w}

{0E}"I mean, clothes that are all fluffy and frilly
are just so exciting...{0F}
So I thought, I'll become Safi..."{w}

{0E}"...Sigh, oh well, can't be helped...
Oh, I know!{0F}
So what do you think of this outfit? Exciting, right!?"{w}{p}"Ta-daa!{w}It's Exciting Safi!"{w}

{0E}"Oh, but as for Mom...
not a w-o-r-d, okay?{0F}
Tee hee hee."{w}

"Welcome! Oh, it's you, everyone!
Thanks so much for the Blue Rain!
Thanks to you, I get excited every single night!"{w}

{0E}"Welcome!
Toner is out at the moment~!{0F}
Tee hee!"{w}

"Who goes there!?{w}Oh, it's you lot."{w}{p}"Seeking an audience with Her Majesty
at this hour of the night...
have you no sense of decency!?"{w}

"For that, I would first like
your permission to tell them
about the magic airship, would you suppose!"{w}

"You lot are quite useful, I see."{w}{p}"Now then, can you find the Wing Soul?{w}It is called the wings of all beings -- a shining wing whose very existence has gained a soul."{w}{p}"Finding it will not be easy.{w}We have not a single clue about it.{w}But once it is found, the Meatrif will be complete."{w}{p}"We are searching by our own means.
You go and try Natori."{w}{p}"I cannot say how far Natori's power will reach,
but I want to cast our net as wide as possible. I am counting on you."{w}

"Smooth sailing so far.
At this rate we will reach the Palace
of the Sun before long."{w}

"Your Majesty,
it seems a magical barrier has been
raised around the Palace of the Sun."{w}

"The hole the magic cannon can open
will not be very large.
Only a few can board the Palace of the Sun."{w}

Through the small hole made by the magic cannon,
you passed from the Meatrif into the
Palace of the Sun.{w}

"Sure, we didn't go up in smoke in the blast, but...
there's no denyin' we've lost power.
Majesty, let's take 'er down nice an' slow."{w}

"Way to go!
I just knew you guys could pull it off!"{w}{p}"I wanted to praise you so much,
I came rushing all the way from Lumisthenes!"{w}

{0E}"So that you bring no shame on the name of Teridon,
I shall erase you without a trace.{0F}
Perish!"{w}

"Oh, it's you guys!
A huge army of monsters attacked the city!
...Huh? You already know?"{w}{p}"Things were pretty crazy over here too, but... I wonder why the monsters suddenly pulled out of the city?"{w}

"What the hell... what am I supposed to do!?
Is it the beard? Is that beard the problem?
If I lace that beard with poison, will you die!?"{w}

"Eeeek! Scary! Scary! So freakin' scaryyy!
Don't chase me while you're spurting a nosebleed!
Hey, what the hell is this!? Some kind of horror show!?!"{w}

{0E}"...? My name? Like I said, it's Decoyki...?
Oh, I'm so sorry! I was so wrapped up in Decoykins!{0F}
I'm Milonya!"{w}

{0E}"Master said something really complicated about it, but{0F}
the bearded look was just so cute that I happily took it!"{w}{p}"My master is Master Shimerief.{w}You'll find her up in the watchtower
in Roscadil every night."{w}

"Deee-cooy-kiiins! Where are youuu?{w}Geez, after I went to all the trouble of saving y... Oh, hello.
Have you seen Decoykins?"{w}{p}"A drunk was picking on Decoykins, so I gave
the drunk a good thrashing, and as thanks I'd lick... ahem.{w}I was just hoping to be allowed a little touch, you know?"{w}

"And that's where you all come in!{w}The goblins are sure to have something good,
so please go and get it from them at Ogre Bay!"{w}{p}"I'm going to try catching Decoykins
all on my own!{w}I'm counting on you!"{w}

"I've been waiting for this!
Thank you so much!!"{w}{p}"And the mechanism's nice and sturdy... The goblins really know their stuff!
Alll right, Decoykins... Guheh~"{w}

"Who're you guys? Haven't seen your faces around.
Whatcha doing? Oh, I got it! You guys are those,
ad-ven-churers! Right? I'm right, aren't I?"{w}

"Okay, now you guess who I am! Go on!
Aww, ya can't, huh? Fine, I'll tell ya!
I'm Decoy! Got it? Yeah, ya got it!"{w}

"Yo, you guys! What's up today?
Oh! Whatcha holding there?
What is it? What is it?"{w}

"Hey, your heads change shape, right?
Do they ever shrink?
Huh? They don't shrink? Liar!"{w}{p}"I know your hair gets shorter!"{w}

"Hey, lemme up on your shoulder!
And don't go saying I'm cute or like a doll!
I'm taking a bit of the stuff on your head!"{w}

"...What, it grows back, right?
The stuff on your face is fine too, y'know.
I'm gonna yank it out! Hup!"{w}

{0E}"Ow! Hey, don't drop me!
...Huh? ...Did it hurt that bad?{0F}
...............Sorry."{w}{p}"I heard Beard Girl's comes off,
so I figured yours did too..."{w}

{0E}"...Sorry, okay? Are you mad?
...You're not mad?{0F}
Okay, then we're good! So gimme that thing!"{w}

"Ahh... but thanks anyway, you guys.
If I think up another good plan, I'm counting on ya!"{w}{p}"Oh yeah, here's your reward!
I don't need it, so keep it!"{w}

{0E}"Never mind the goods. But...{0F}
the copy of Mujirod's writings I had sought for many years{w}was stolen by ruffians, along with the rest, I'm told."{w}{p}"It is filled with words that cannot be replaced.{w}I thought my attachment to things
had faded away long ago, but"{w}{p}"that one, it seems, is the exception."{w}

"Here at the temple, besides putting light into Fame,
we can also tell you about the myths,
or give you an oracle."{w}{p}"Feel free to ask me about anything."{w}

{0E}"Seeing karma is what a fortune-teller does,
but we can read other people's, never our own.{0F}
If we could, I'd be raking it in by now..."{w}

{0E}"Guess you really can't cheat after all...
My luck was supposed to be at its very best... and yet...?{0F}
...Oh!"{w}
